{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-30T15:20:03.397Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7b0e58428f53e3aaeaafb372","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-m6ig79"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Pull-request CI requests 33 hosted-runner jobs per push against the account's 20-job concurrency cap, so required checks wait hours before they start"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Every push to a pm-cli pull request starts 25 CI jobs plus 8 jobs in CodeQL, Docs, Security and CodSpeed: 33 jobs against a GitHub Free account cap of 20 concurrent jobs (5 macOS) shared by about 30 ecosystem repositories. pm-cli alone therefore always queues, and under ecosystem load required checks start hours late. Ten of the 25 CI jobs are sub-minute runtime probes (Runtime smoke x3, Packed first run x6, Telemetry regression) that each pay a full queue wait and runner setup. The Windows cohorts also ran with max-parallel 2, which queued the 10-minute native cohort behind a script shard, so even an idle account took 28 minutes."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["ci","github-actions","performance","runner-queue"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-30T15:20:03.397Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-30T15:20:03.397Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"build-test runs one job per OS that performs the Node 22.18.0 and Node 24 packed first runs, the dist version smoke, the Node 22 telemetry and snapshot regressions (ubuntu), the native macOS checks and the full Windows npx/bunx acceptance; first-run and node22-telemetry jobs are gone; gates matrix is static+smokes: typecheck runs in static, both compatibility gates run in smokes, and the duplicated contracts:check/sdk:surface:check invocations are removed (quality:static still runs both checks); windows-regression-cohorts has no max-parallel cap; ci-workflow-contract, packed-first-run, node22-telemetry-workflow tests, gate-registry.json and defect-recurrence-policy.json reference the new job layout and pass; gate-registry passes; main branch protection requires Packed runtime (ubuntu-latest|macos-latest|windows-latest) instead of the ten removed names, and no required check is left that no workflow emits; the PR introducing the change records its uncontended wall clock and per-job durations"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-doxj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"GitHub-hosted runners, GitHub Free personal account unbraind (20 concurrent jobs, 5 macOS), 2026-10-30"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A pm-cli PR push requests at most 15 CI jobs (23 across all PR workflows) while every proof that ran before still runs, the Windows cohorts run concurrently, and the uncontended CI wall clock stays under 20 minutes."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"PR #1629 head f5644c144: CI run 41060643643 created 13:07:35Z, first job (Build foundation) started 14:41:18Z, 94 minutes queued. Uncontended run 41029457428: 25 jobs, 28 minutes wall clock; the native Windows cohort started at +17 min because of max-parallel 2. Static gate ran contracts:check and sdk:surface:check twice (once directly, once inside pnpm lint = quality:static)."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"ci"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-29bwud","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-10-30T15:20:03.397Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"1938317fb9e862869a6b3476e0ab16849e9f8a99dd5bac5d121080817a40fcd8","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"83a472b20cc868880a9d3cda349ca3cda12e59b01c2e818a28421b538cab5c87"}
