{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-30T15:31:16.878Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7b0e58428f53e3aaeaafb372","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-m6ig79","lineage:pm-m6ig79","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-m6ig79","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-m6ig79","lineage:pm-m6ig79","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-30T15:31:16.878Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-30T15:31:16.878Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation on branch ci/bounded-pr-runner-demand. ci.yml: build-test is now 'Packed runtime (<os>)' x3 (ubuntu/macos/windows). Each runs packed first run on Node 22.18.0 then 24 in separate prefix/cache/home roots (pm-first-run-node<version>) before any dependency install, the dist version smoke on 24, then platform proofs: ubuntu = Node 22 telemetry + linked snapshot regressions (Node 22 setup, pnpm install under 22), macOS = registry/completion/merge settlement/portability, Windows = full npm npx + Bun bunx acceptance (timeout 25). Jobs first-run and node22-telemetry removed. gates matrix static+smokes: typecheck step moved to static, compatibility-check and workspace-compatibility moved to smokes; static no longer runs pnpm contracts:check / pnpm sdk:surface:check directly because pnpm lint (quality:static) runs contracts-snapshot, capability surfaces, error catalog and sdk-surface-snapshot checks. windows-regression-cohorts lost max-parallel 2. Per-push CI jobs 25 -> 15 (all PR workflows 33 -> 23; macOS jobs 3 -> 1, Windows 5 -> 4). gate-registry.json drops ci.yml#first-run and ci.yml#node22-telemetry (both gates already list ci.yml#build-test); defect-recurrence-policy renames CI / Runtime smoke (macos-latest, Node 24) to CI / Packed runtime (macos-latest). Docs: TESTING.md gains 'CI Job Layout and Runner Budget', PACKED_FIRST_RUN.md names the per-OS job."}]}],"before_hash":"92d4c899f0855fef80f63af8b38908893ff2b8a55557f6f818c6c6123d21e980","after_hash":"28eefbea76446f2d47c641bcaa7752f099848214c55d3907b1c8fac9869fb16c","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"036680f48103d9d940de7e48ae71de3aa8cd641fb70c3157421c6100eb83e1d3"}
